 "summary_html": "<p>\nAn <span><i lang=\"la\"><b>ex libris</b></i></span>, also known as a <b>bookplate</b>, is a printed or decorative label pasted into a book, often on the front endpaper, to indicate ownership. Simple typographical bookplates are termed \"book labels\".</p>",
 "summary_text": "\nAn ex libris, also known as a bookplate, is a printed or decorative label pasted into a book, often on the front endpaper, to indicate ownership. Simple typographical bookplates are termed \"book labels\".",
